    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v2-raw/005.wav",
    "seconds": 11.84,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "b005dbb8891b2b3cbaa758c04b93f423d136c418b883a87010b64c207e66df7a",
    "elapsedSeconds": 64.54896140098572
  },
  "006": {
    "text": "他提出一个大胆猜想：会不会是一种蛋白，既负责接住光，又直接充当离子通道？难处在于，蛋白一离开衣藻，就很容易失活。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
