    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v2-raw/007.wav",
    "seconds": 10.88,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "024c6994a35279a67f416447bafdd84b64c5f7ceb7634c5bf0661dd02126dcce",
    "elapsedSeconds": 38.402507305145264
  },
  "008": {
    "text": "蓝光一照，通道在约零点二毫秒内打开。带正电的离子顺着电化学梯度穿过去，蛙卵膜两侧的电压立刻变化。这个结果在二零零三年发表。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
